WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.961
Import your material, check the masks, review, and record what you remember.

00:00:04.961 --> 00:00:06.670
Here is how to get started.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.430
On Home, choose a photo, use the camera, or import a PDF.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.455
Here we will import one PDF page.

00:00:20.455 --> 00:00:22.270
Select your file to begin.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.550
Each page is saved, with masks created automatically.

00:00:31.183 --> 00:00:33.984
Open your saved material from Library.

00:00:35.183 --> 00:00:36.850
You can study right away.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.184
Check or adjust the hidden words only when needed.

00:00:40.817 --> 00:00:44.217
Open Adjustments, then choose which words to hide.

00:00:45.817 --> 00:00:49.017
Adjust the AI selection, or select words manually.

00:00:49.817 --> 00:00:52.657
Tap a word to change whether it is hidden.

00:00:52.657 --> 00:00:56.377
When you are happy with your selection, finish editing.

00:00:58.817 --> 00:01:04.657
You can begin a review yourself, or enable review reminders and start from a notification when it arrives.

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:10.697
Back in Library, start studying from your selection.

00:01:11.817 --> 00:01:14.814
Choose your materials and question order.

00:01:14.814 --> 00:01:18.177
Select Auto or Manual, then start your review.

00:01:19.817 --> 00:01:23.584
In Manual mode, try to recall the hidden word first.

00:01:23.584 --> 00:01:26.337
Then tap its mask to check the answer.

00:01:28.817 --> 00:01:30.525
Use Next Mask to continue.

00:01:30.525 --> 00:01:33.417
Think about each answer before revealing it.

00:01:36.817 --> 00:01:41.772
In Auto mode, you have three seconds to think before the answer appears.

00:01:41.772 --> 00:01:44.457
The review then moves on automatically.

00:01:45.817 --> 00:01:46.919
Need more time?

00:01:46.919 --> 00:01:51.697
Pause the review, check the page, then resume when you are ready.

00:01:53.817 --> 00:01:59.217
The app moves through the page, so you can review words alongside their diagrams and context.

00:02:01.817 --> 00:02:05.808
After each page, choose Remembered, Unsure, or Not remembered.

00:02:05.808 --> 00:02:08.577
Record how well you recalled that material.

00:02:11.817 --> 00:02:14.057
Finish the session to save your review result.

00:02:16.817 --> 00:02:22.057
Your results and study activity help the app adjust the next review cycle.

00:02:23.817 --> 00:02:25.989
Keep adding your own material.

00:02:25.989 --> 00:02:31.057
In Library, you can choose random order or prioritize weaker material.

00:02:32.817 --> 00:02:36.522
You can share the study sheets you create with other people.

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:39.177
Open the share menu to send a masked image.

00:02:41.817 --> 00:02:44.107
The free version shares an image.

00:02:44.107 --> 00:02:48.897
With the paid unlock, you can share editable AI Study Sheet material.

00:02:49.817 --> 00:02:53.657
Next, open Settings to make your reviews suit you.

00:02:54.817 --> 00:02:58.697
Choose how many pages to include in each review set.

00:03:00.817 --> 00:03:02.810
You can use a time guide instead.

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:06.857
It helps choose pages; it does not end your review when time is up.

00:03:07.817 --> 00:03:11.134
Choose how many masks Auto mode reveals together.

00:03:11.134 --> 00:03:13.977
Use Auto adjust, or choose a fixed number.

00:03:15.817 --> 00:03:23.057
Adjust the default amount hidden in your material, from fewer masks to a denser pre-test review.

00:03:23.817 --> 00:03:29.577
You can keep mask outlines after revealing answers, and choose whether to keep automatic masks up to date.

00:03:31.817 --> 00:03:35.663
Review reminders can be automatic, daily, weekly, or off.

00:03:35.663 --> 00:03:38.497
Choose a frequency that fits your routine.

00:03:39.817 --> 00:03:42.627
For weekly reminders, choose a weekday and time.

00:03:42.627 --> 00:03:45.497
Save your changes when you are ready to use them.

00:03:48.817 --> 00:03:52.817
Choose light or dark appearance, or follow your system setting.

00:03:54.817 --> 00:03:56.936
You can change the app color here too.

00:03:56.936 --> 00:04:00.897
Pick a theme you like, and the accent color changes throughout the app.

00:04:03.817 --> 00:04:07.297
You can also change the app display language in Settings.

00:04:08.817 --> 00:04:13.007
Use backup export and import to keep a copy of your material.

00:04:13.007 --> 00:04:15.137
Help is available here as well.

00:04:16.817 --> 00:04:19.737
Start by importing one page of your own material.
